{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "contract": {
    "id": "modkit/codec-contribution",
    "major": 1
  },
  "id": "blizzard/sc2-map",
  "displayName": "StarCraft II map",
  "status": "partial",
  "runtimeVariants": [
    {
      "variantId": "trusted-node",
      "entrypoint": "./dist/modules/map/codecs/package/portable/codec.mjs",
      "target": {
        "environments": [
          "node"
        ]
      },
      "executionProfile": "trusted-in-process",
      "requestedPermissionClasses": [
        "read-source",
        "write-source"
      ]
    },
    {
      "variantId": "portable",
      "entrypoint": "./dist/modules/map/codecs/package/portable/codec.mjs",
      "target": {
        "environments": [
          "browser-worker",
          "node-worker"
        ]
      },
      "executionProfile": "worker-brokered",
      "requestedPermissionClasses": [
        "read-source",
        "write-source"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Opens MPQ-backed maps through the host-owned blizzard/mpq container alias and uses the same bounded namespace parser for loose maps.",
    "The native adapter parses every pinned modeled entry family, preserves every unknown entry, composes DocumentHeader, DocumentInfo and version metadata, and renders height (base, adjustments or sum), height-sum, cliff, pathing, cell-flags, painted-pathing, texture, texture-overlay, overlay, vertex-color, cliff-vertices, cliff-cells, overview and navigation PNG layers; its facts carry the map name, MapInfo size, playable area, theme, planet and start locations.",
    "The richer M4 edit-world transaction remains the write surface; the host delegates native-preserving or deterministic MPQ commit to blizzard/mpq.",
    "Cross-codec coordinated rename, a 3D map scene, signing, native launch execution and installed-editor acceptance remain outside this milestone."
  ],
  "spec": {
    "formatRefs": [
      {
        "formatId": "sc2-map",
        "label": "StarCraft II map"
      }
    ],
    "roles": [
      "semantic"
    ],
    "sourceTopology": "namespace",
    "artifactStages": [
      "authored",
      "compiled",
      "runtime"
    ],
    "openIntents": [
      "probe",
      "inspect",
      "full",
      "export"
    ],
    "match": {
      "extensions": [
        "sc2map"
      ]
    },
    "anchorDocuments": [
      "MapInfo"
    ],
    "probe": {
      "kind": "namespace",
      "markers": [
        "DocumentHeader",
        "MapInfo",
        "Objects",
        "Regions",
        "t3HeightMap",
        "t3SyncPathingInfo"
      ],
      "maxEntries": 6,
      "maxBytes": 65536,
      "maxDepth": 4,
      "maxPathBytes": 4096
    },
    "representations": [
      {
        "id": "archive-namespace",
        "contract": "common.archive/entry-namespace",
        "major": 1,
        "stage": "authored",
        "lossy": false
      },
      {
        "id": "map-layers",
        "contract": "common.map/layers",
        "major": 1,
        "stage": "authored",
        "lossy": false
      }
    ],
    "fidelityEvidence": [
      {
        "formatId": "sc2-map",
        "representationId": "map-layers",
        "claim": {
          "roundTrip": "semantic",
          "preservesUnknownData": true,
          "notes": [
            "A layer write changes only the written samples of t3HeightMap, t3SyncCliffLevel or t3SyncPathingInfo; the header, every untouched cell, the other fields of a height cell (adjustment, mask) and trailing bytes keep their bytes, the host commits a folder map's plan, the map reopens with the written samples, and undo restores the original (modules/map/test/sc2-map-layer-window.test.ts).",
            "Object, region and reference edits keep untouched XML bytes and unknown attributes (test/sc2-map-world-writer.test.ts); a region shape the writer normalizes reports preservesUnknownData false and is not covered.",
            "t3SyncHeightMap is not recomputed after a height write; the plan says so with the warning blizzard/sc2-map-sync-height-not-updated."
          ]
        },
        "evidenceId": "sc2-map-layer-window-v1",
        "corpusId": "modkit-extensions-blizzard/starcraft2/modules/map/test/sc2-map-layer-window.test.ts",
        "corpusDigest": "none:proof-suite",
        "conformanceProfile": "modkit/codec-contribution-v1",
        "optionsFingerprint": "options:none",
        "inputClass": "sc2-map-grid-documents",
        "provenAt": "2026-09-26T00:00:00Z"
      }
    ],
    "publishesDataSources": [
      {
        "contract": "common.view/namespace-entry-source",
        "major": 1
      },
      {
        "contract": "common.view/tree-data-source",
        "major": 1
      },
      {
